OL,3,AUS army secretary resigns after months
OL,4,Aof tension
OL,5,
OL,6,FUS Army Secretary Dan Driscoll has
OL,7,Fsubmitted his resignation after about
OL,8,F18 months in the role.
OL,10,FHis departure was confirmed by CBS, the
OL,11,FBBC's US media partner, which reported
OL,12,Fit came after months of conflict
OL,13,Fbetween him and Defence Secretary Pete
OL,14,FHegseth.
OL,16,FThe youngest-ever army secretary has
OL,17,Foften been referred to as President
OL,18,FDonald Trump's "drone guy".
OL,23,APub: 01-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
