OL,3,AUS army secretary resigns after months
OL,4,Aof tension
OL,5,
OL,6,FDriscoll, 41, has been "highly
OL,7,Feffective" in advancing Trump's agenda
OL,8,F"to Make America Strong Again" and
OL,9,Fprovided "outstanding leadership"
OL,10,Fduring military operations, the White
OL,11,FHouse said in a statement given to CBS.
